@startuml Activity_Diagram_UC03
title Activity Diagram: UC-03 Manage Products

|Customer|
start
:Customer selects "Products" on the Home Page;
|System|
:Retrieve and display the current product catalog;
|Customer|
:Select a specific product to view its full details;
|System|
:Display product details (price breakdown, size options, ingredients, allergen info);

if (Customer wants to customize the selected product?) then (Yes)
  :Start Manage Cake Design use case;
else (No)
  :Continue browsing the catalog;
endif

|Staff/Admin|
:Select "Manage Products" from the Admin Panel Dashboard;
|System|
:Display the Manage Products page with all current products;
|Staff/Admin|
:Choose Add New Product, or select an existing product to edit or remove;
|System|
:Display blank form for add, or pre-filled form for edit;
|Staff/Admin|
:Enter or update the product details and click Save or confirm Remove;
|System|
:Validate required fields and formatting;
if (Information valid and complete?) then (Yes)
  if (Product update conflicts with an active order?) then (Yes)
    :Warn Staff/Admin before saving change;
    if (Staff/Admin confirms save?) then (Yes)
      :Save the product record;
    else (No)
      :Cancel the update;
    endif
  else (No)
    :Save the product record to the database;
  endif
  :Refresh the live catalog;
  :Display confirmation message;
else (No)
  :Prompt for missing or corrected fields;
  :Do not save the record;
endif

stop
@enduml
